sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant Security
    participant Database
    Client->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>Security: Verify BCrypt password
    Security->>Database: Load user and role
    API-->>Client: Access JWT + refresh token
    Client->>API: Bearer JWT
    API->>Security: Verify signature, expiry, role
    Security-->>API: Authenticated principal
    API-->>Client: Protected resource or 403
